  "description": "Seo-Woo and Ji-Hyeok used to be in a cult relationship. However, Seo-Woo breaks up with Ji-Hyeok and pursues his dream of becoming a teacher, avoiding relationships with men. Seo-Woo finally becomes a teacher, but Ji-Hyeok, who appears next to him as a fellow teacher, keeps on worrying about him. Seo-Woo thinks about his past with Ji-Hyeok and even orders adult products, and Ji-Hyeok catches him. Ji-Hyeok threatens Seo-Woo, not really threatening, and this leads to their reunion...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
